## Playbooks (skills)

Skills live under `.codex/skills/`. Add a row per skill as it lands.

| Skill | Use when |
|:--|:--|
| `doc-hygiene-audit` | Capture/reconcile/restructure the doc corpus |
| `governance-sync` | Adopt or update the shared governance kit (copier + reconcile) |
| `domain-modeling` | Keep the glossary & ADRs current; verify naming; capture settled decisions |
| `grilling` | Shared model-invoked decision-interview primitive (serial or frontier batch) |
| `grill-with-docs` | Explicit-user decision interview, with settled glossary/ADR capture |
| `show-gap` | Bounded agent-invokable fit audit; discussion/spec writing require user intent |
| `explain-layman` | Explicit-user governed stakeholder explainer artifacts |

